OL,3,GNEWSAQuestions over police chief
OL,4,Arecruitment after candidate dropped
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Warwickshire Police and Crime
OL,7,FCommissioner (PCC) is facing questions
OL,8,Fover the recruitment of a new chief
OL,9,Fconstable after withdrawing the
OL,10,Fpreferred candidate's job offer.
OL,12,FEmma Bond, currently Assistant Chief
OL,13,FConstable at Police Scotland, was named
OL,14,Fin May as the preferred choice to
OL,15,Freplace Alex Franklin-Smith following
OL,16,Fhis retirement in April.
OL,18,FBut more than four months later, the
OL,19,FPCC announced that Bond's preferred
OL,20,Fcandidate status had been withdrawn,
OL,21,Fmeaning she will no longer take up the
OL,22,Frole.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
